WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.422
Now that the next-token loop is clear, we can control how the next token is chosen.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:10.494
This is where greedy decoding, temperature, and top P enter the picture.

00:00:11.006 --> 00:00:17.648
We will also look at base, instruct, and chat checkpoints, because the way a model was post-trained changes how you

00:00:17.648 --> 00:00:19.360
should talk to it.
